			"notes": "This mod allows for exciting item speedruns in Minecraft! Whenever you begin to create your world - you are presented with a couple of wheels you can spin, to determine your goal. Once you create the world - the timer will start and your goal is to find that item, while following the additional modifier that you got!\n# Scavenger Host\n\nA Minecraft Fabric mod for item speedruns.\n\n## Features\n- Random target item\n- Random modifiers\n- Automatic timer\n- Speedrun gameplay\n\n## Requirements\n- Fabric Loader 0.18.4\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n\n## Dependencies\n- Fabric API\n- ShatterLib\n- Architectury"
		}
	],
